---
layout: blogLayout.liquid
title: Thanks for signing up
subtitle: You're almost done
pagination:
 data: collections.posts
 size: 3
 alias: articlesPosts
 reverse: true
changefreq: monthly
priority: 0.9
---
<p>You should receive an email shortly which will ask you to confirm your address. Sometimes these messages can end up in the Junk mail folder so don't forget to check.</p>

<hr>

{% for post in articlesPosts %}
    <h2 class="articleList-articleTitle"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2> 
	<p>{{ post.data.subtitle }}</p>
	<p class="articleList-date">
	<time date-time="{{ post.date.toISOString() }}">{{ post.data.dateFormat }}</time>
	</p>
{% endfor %}